{"channelId":"UCTCQKg24OrarFSLw1kymxJw","row":["Cancer Rehab PT",743000,"Cancer Rehab PT provides people living with and beyond cancer and lymphedema with education, resources, and support to reclaim control of their everyday lives. Hi everyone! My name is Kelly and I am a Doctor of Physical Therapy (DPT) and I specialize in oncology and lymphedema, as well as lymphatic health. This channel focuses on various treatments and education for the management of the side effects. We also share tools to help reduce and manage lymphedema, along with lymphatic health & wellness.\n\nPlease subscribe to follow along! But please know, that by subscribing to my channel you understand that this channel and content is general information only. It's not personal medical advice and you will always need to speak to your doctor regarding individualized care. I cannot, nor will I, respond to personal medical questions. \nPlease read and understand all disclaimers in each video for more details. Thank you!\n\nFacebook: Cancer Rehab PT\nInstagram: cancerrehabpt","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTCQKg24OrarFSLw1kymxJw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTCQKg24OrarFSLw1kymxJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:59.121Z","channelId":"UCTCQKg24OrarFSLw1kymxJw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c30703772c5833b53a22ca976f9a869fe23063378387179962dd1c45296e793c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"36d5896099117efd21ce2bc9b8d4795dc367d1c7e79c5f5ece304c1c7947c007"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTCQKg24OrarFSLw1kymxJw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:17:01.943Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/cancerrehabpt","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":69765,"raw":"69765","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/cancerrehabpt/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:31:16.192Z"},{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/cancerreh